[h1]库存标签 / Inventory Tags[/h1]

为储物容器增加 [b]分类、排序和自动打包[/b]，方便管理食物、医疗用品、工具和材料。为不同箱包设置允许存放的物品类别，按需要调整物品栏顺序，并调用原版配方打包零散物品。

[h2]支持哪些容器？[/h2]
支持兼容的储物家具、便携背包和车辆货物容器。不对角色主物品栏、地面列表或功能型设备容器统一套用储物规则；原有容量、访问条件和物品放入限制保持不变。

[h2]三个主要功能[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]分类[/b]：每个容器可勾选多个允许存放的类别。16个一级分组按用途整理，二级沿用游戏物品栏的原有分类名称，随当前游戏语言显示；可逐项勾选、整组切换，或批量全选、全不选。
[*][b]排序[/b]：提供原版、数量、重量和时间排序，支持升序、降序。时间指记录到的存入顺序；没有历史记录的旧物品使用默认回退顺序，不补造时间。排序只改变当前玩家看到的列表，不搬动物品。
[*][b]自动打包[/b]：通过原版制作动作执行支持的打包配方，从当前容器取用打包材料，并将产物通过正常转移动作放回。可使用角色身上可访问、且不会在配方中消耗的工具，不代替所有制作配方。
[/list]

[h2]操作与设置[/h2]
[list]
[*]通过储物容器右键菜单，或物品栏底部的[b]分类、排序、自动打包[/b]三个按钮操作；提供手柄菜单导航。
[*]三项功能分别设有沙盒开关，可按需要独立开启或关闭。
[*]分类支持整组或逐项选择；批量全选、全不选需要确认。
[*]提供英文、简体中文和繁体中文。二级分类使用游戏当前语言，不另造一套物品分类名称。
[/list]

[b]本模组不增加容器容量，也不会把附近物品自动分拣到不同箱子。[/b]分类用于设置允许存放的类别，排序用于调整显示，自动打包用于执行支持的原版打包配方。

[h2]版本与多人使用[/h2]
当前为0.1.1-LT9测试版，最低游戏版本为42.20.2。多人客户端与服务端请使用相同版本。已有离线检查不代表所有其他模组组合都已完成游戏内验证。

[h2]English[/h2]
Add [b]Categories, Sort and Auto Pack[/b] to supported storage containers. Set allowed item categories for different containers, change the inventory list order, and pack loose supplies using supported vanilla recipes.

[h2]Which containers are supported?[/h2]
Compatible storage furniture, portable bags and vehicle cargo containers. The character's main inventory, floor lists and functional appliances are not generic storage-rule targets. Original capacity, access requirements and item-acceptance restrictions remain unchanged.

[h2]Three main features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Categories[/b]: choose multiple allowed categories for each container. Sixteen purpose-based parent groups organize the game's existing inventory categories. Child names follow your current game language. Select individual categories, toggle a group, or use Select All / Deselect All.
[*][b]Sort[/b]: vanilla, quantity, weight and time sorting, in ascending or descending order. Time uses recorded arrival order; older items without records use a fallback order rather than invented timestamps. Sorting changes only the current player's list display, not the physical items.
[*][b]Auto Pack[/b]: run supported vanilla packing recipes through the original crafting actions. Materials come from the selected container, and outputs return through normal transfer actions. Non-consumed tools carried by your character can also be used when accessible. This does not replace every crafting recipe.
[/list]

[h2]Controls and settings[/h2]
[list]
[*]Use a storage container's context menu or the three inventory-window buttons: [b]Categories, Sort and Auto Pack[/b]. Controller menu navigation is included.
[*]Each feature has its own sandbox enable option.
[*]Choose categories individually or by group. Bulk Select All / Deselect All requires confirmation.
[*]English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese are included. Native child-category names follow the game language.
[/list]

[b]This mod does not increase container capacity or automatically distribute nearby items between containers.[/b] Categories set storage rules, Sort changes the display, and Auto Pack runs supported vanilla packing recipes.

[h2]Version and multiplayer[/h2]
Current test build:0.1.1-LT9. Minimum game version:42.20.2. Multiplayer clients and servers should use the same mod version. Offline checks do not establish in-game compatibility with every other mod combination.

